{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019213027126-1019_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261019213027\"/><p>史丹福大學承諾積極尋求改善空間。</p><p>美國史丹福大學一名女畢業生近日在《史丹福日報》發表文章，揭露19歲時在學校宿舍遭性侵經歷，更批評校方與執法機關多年來失職。史丹福大學則發聲明，指聽證程序是由完全獨立的校外仲裁人主持，校方並無制裁與否的決定權，也已意識到程序過長的問題，承諾積極尋求改善空間。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T13:39:52.348725+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:30:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:58:47.482482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:37:35.903725+00:00","content_hash":"f3774f13e0884baa3ead86ccb03863ed064564191719cb332ceba4f60bf9e4f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}